March 8, 2023

When performing a re-design (i.e such as for Lab 3 and Lab 4, ), it is best
to create a new PlanAhead project and then within this new PlanAhead
project, within SDK create a new Application Project INSTEAD of simply
creating a new SDK Application project within a previosly existing
PlanAhead project. Doing the latter  has led to unexpected incorrect results
withing the new SDK Application project which necessitate powering off the
Zynq board and re-programming the new SDK application project (i.e the ELF file)
to the Zynq board. 

So, in summary, always create a complete new PlanAhead project for every design.


